# Architecture Storyteller - packaging rules
#
# The extension ships compiled JavaScript only. It deliberately contains no
# copy of the engine: the engine is resolved from the workspace at runtime
# (tools/storyteller-engine/cli.py, or storyteller.enginePath).

.vscode/**
src/**
node_modules/**
scripts/**
orchestrator/**
tools/**
tsconfig.json
tsconfig.webview.json
package-lock.json

# Development-only Python utilities live in scripts/** (already excluded).

# Sources and maps: dist/*.js is all that is needed at runtime.
**/*.ts
**/*.map
